{"id":"n16191-1-8","stage":2,"title":"강수량 · 降水量","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16191-1-8-1","ko":"올여름은 강수량이 좀 많은 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得今年夏天的降雨量好像有点多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올여름은","meaning":"今年；夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"올：今年；여름：夏，夏天，夏季；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"},{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22072","senseId":"1","lemma":"올","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올여름은","audio":"/audio/b6cb6fdc03e76bcae004.mp3"}},{"text":"강수량이","meaning":"降水量","explanation":"강수량：降水量；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강수량","audio":"/audio/899b556394c87da97906.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16191","senseId":"1","lemma":"강수량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강수량이","audio":"/audio/59d0e7f7f06d58d39a35.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explana